{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2f4c402a8e5c1923d93bf74efbacb495153f337be0f3c7b8de1b19a7117f2df1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Remote pastes stream over SSH into a self-pruning cache with 7-day retention and a 50 MB cap, pasting the remote path into the agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2fff585020710d7406ed760f7c86cc9007800753b22df2a23012ad968405703e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: pushing a v* tag triggers release automation that builds, notarizes, Sparkle-signs, and publishes a release, and CI fails if CHANGELOG.md lacks a matching version section."},{"claim_ids":["clm_36b1573bbb5562055b08b47ec95ed140bef84db21623a3eb4a1daec021d3b13f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tailcat devices pay a roughly 1-2 second tunnel handshake per operation, and standalone shells and the Files workspace still require SSH rather than the tunnel."},{"claim_ids":["clm_669f94fde187ef1bfc843da0287eb170cb4f28f90ac137a3808b729ab4933e44"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A two-pane file manager browses local and SSH files side by side with transfers supporting progress, cancellation, and Replace/Keep Both conflict handling."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6af4d840972683d52c763ad52341452a3af85f677e3d54088169363b1486bad3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The embedded terminal renders via libghostty (Metal) rather than SwiftTerm, with herdrm layering light-mode color adaptation, readline chords, and agent-aware paste on top."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d6368bdbca0fed50f8b2df2b2b17415c11f40750c5b762409516802cb8841933"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"On the iOS/iPadOS client, tailcat devices carry herdr's control plane (spaces, agents, prompting) but not a live terminal, which remains SSH-only."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2f4c402a8e5c1923d93bf74efbacb495153f337be0f3c7b8de1b19a7117f2df1","clm_2fff585020710d7406ed760f7c86cc9007800753b22df2a23012ad968405703e","clm_36b1573bbb5562055b08b47ec95ed140bef84db21623a3eb4a1daec021d3b13f","clm_669f94fde187ef1bfc843da028